      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The Fall back Shaider is probably Mobile Standard Lite\n\nTry using Autodesk and set roughness to 0 and MetalIc to 1\n\nAutodesk has the roughness backwards so 0 is shine and 1 is dull\n\nIf it's dull but has it MetalIc it's falling back to Mobile Standard Lite\n\nIf it dull without MetalIc is probably a Legacy shaider\n\nIf it's still MetalIc and shiny then that's a rabbit hole",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
